{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>交通銀行(香港)呈獻：雲端對談第六系列　專訪大館藝術總監田霏宇(上)</strong></p><p>・田霏宇接受雲端對談訪問<br>・大館藝術總監專訪<br>・訪問分上集播出<br>・訪談內容涉藝術範疇<br>・由交通銀行(香港)呈獻<br>・Now新聞節目系列<br>・專訪聚焦大館藝術工作</p><p>暫時未能從Now 新聞擷取全文。</p><p><a href=\"https://news.now.com/home/local/player?newsId=666176\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">閱讀原文</a></p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T12:19:11.499633+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"minimal","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T12:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T18:37:43.413420+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T12:17:36.051147+00:00","content_hash":"a9228dc95a9981d83e631a0944d2796651f756a0df22da8c66eadba393d9f38c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}